SilverShadow Daily Run implementation
-------------------------------------
This fork implements Daily Run seed retrieval in these files:

    .github/workflows/publish-daily-seed.yml
    patches/all/node/daily-run-seed.js
    new-files/src/system/daily-run/
    new-files/test/tests/system/daily-run/
    scripts/daily-run-archive-core.mjs
    scripts/sync-daily-seed-archive.mjs
    assets/daily-seeds-fallback.json

The workflow requests the seed from the official PokeRogue API and publishes a
dated JSON document to this fork's own seed branch. The game client requests
the historical archive from silvershadowkat/pokerogue-offline and embeds a
validated snapshot for offline use. It does not request seed
data from PokeRogue-Offline/pokerogue-offline or from a service operated by
Scooom.

